        "title": "Smells Like Tuna",
        "text": "One of the 16 CD Player songs. The title bends Nirvana's Smells Like Teen Spirit (1991), the song that made Seattle grunge famous. Skitchin' (EA, 1994), Mega Drive / Genesis. Music by Jeff van Dyck."
