      },
      {
        "title": "Room for two",
        "text": "EA was short of rooms, so Jeff shared one with Traz Damji, who was scoring NBA. They heard each other through the headphones, swapped parts and jammed. The credits list Jeff as 'Jeff Dyck'."
      }
